  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This dataset contains Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping products for activation EMSR931. On the 10 September 2026 at 20:15, a forest fire is reported to have affected the Island of Brac in Coratia and is spreading towards the settlements of Milna and Nerežišća. Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping is requested to provide initial rough estimation, fire extent and damage assessment emergency mapping. **Citation:** Copernicus Emergency Management Service (© 2026 European Union), EMSR931 **Product types present in this dataset's resources:** **DEL (Delineation)**: maps the extent of the event itself (eg. flood, fire, landslide boundary). **GRA (Grading)**: assesses damage to individual features (eg. buildings, infrastructure). Where a GeoPackage download is available for an Area of Interest/round, it already contains every layer with its official Copernicus styling and colours - prefer it in GIS software over the zipped shapefile download."
  ],
